			<div class="content" id="post-content-4826385">
									

<p>I will not pretend that this article is any sort of pioneering effort into the world of philosophy in SCPs, but rather it represents my sincere and personal wish for all of us, myself included, to continue to seek balance and to challenge our preconceptions. We must learn to find The Middle Way and walk the liminal path between the order and chaos of the world around us.</p>
<p>There are many aspects of this piece I have chosen not to comment on and clarify in this post. This is not to say that I would not talk about them but rather I think the piece as a whole is better served by being left open-ended. I am eager to see how the journey is perceived by those with other perspectives.</p>
<p>Thank you for all of your readership in the two years I have been posting my works to the wiki. I have so much more I want to share and I only now feel as if I have learned how to walk in between the legs of these literary giants that I am privileged to share the space with. This is the most important thing I have ever written and I couldnt feel better about taking the risk to share it with you.</p>
<p>An special thank you to users <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2527320); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2527320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606154806" alt="LordStonefish" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2527320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2527320); return false;">LordStonefish</a></span> , <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4187161); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187161&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606154806" alt="plaidypus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187161)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4187161); return false;">plaidypus</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quadraginta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6391595); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6391595&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606154806" alt="Quadraginta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6391595)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quadraginta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6391595); return false;">Quadraginta</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4384469); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4384469&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606154806" alt="Dysadron" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4384469)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4384469); return false;">Dysadron</a></span> who all provided critical feedback on the finished draft and helped me realize a much more rounded final product. An additional thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606154806" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4916887)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;">MalyceGraves</a></span> for their help in brainstorming for the long game over the many months it took me to arrive to this destination.</p>
