														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4826433">
									

<p>This is competently executed, but there's nothing particularly compelling that I feel like I haven't seen before. &quot;[Foundation thing] is anomalously fake&quot; and &quot;spooky people talking gibberish mysteriously&quot; are both pretty well-worn tropes, and aside from the presentation of a quasi-feral O5 council, there wasn't much that really caught my eye.</p>
<p>Ending it on the justification for why this needed a new object class soured it for me, so I gotta -1 it.</p>

